{
  "linkedin": "Heading out into the New Zealand backcountry? The Ember 2 stove is designed to help you prepare meals efficiently on the trail. In our testing, it boils a litre of water in about 3.5 minutes. Weighing just 85 grams and folding down into a 6 cm case, it is a compact addition to your pack and runs on standard screw-on gas canisters. Remember to always cook outside your tent, as stoves produce carbon monoxide. Available for $89. Read more on our blog: https://acmeoutdoorgear.example.com/blog/ember-2 #AcmeOutdoorGear #NewZealand #Tramping",
